;[[V14.5]]
* {{sbc|Bug Fix:}} Minion execute passive can now properly be triggered to grant gold and consume a quest stack if the nearby allied champion was on the very edge of the item's range.

;[[V14.4]]
* Quest recharge timer increased to 20 seconds from 18.
* First charge timer reduced to 1:50 from 2:08.
* {{sbc|Removed:}} No longer provides bonus stacks if purchased later in the game.
* {{sbc|Bug Fix:}} Passive no longer appears to trigger despite not doing so if the allied champion was at the edge of the item's passive range.

