* {{sbc|Bug Fix:}} Executed minions no longer counts toward the reduced gold penalty.

;[[V14.2]]
* {{sbc|New Effect:}} Minion gold penalty now accounts for all champions that have a Support item, instead of each individual user. Additionally, every champion with a Support item now contributes towards hitting the minion penalty.

